      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "1. Set your key in **ComfyUI menu → Extensions → OpenRouter → OpenRouter settings**.\n2. Upload the voicemail in **Voicemail**.\n3. Press **Run**. The transcript and a spoken callback script are saved under `voicemail`."
      ],
      "title": "Start Here"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
